This is just a slight variation of the standard Ford Ludios level.

I added a partly frozen river to have a little landscape variation.

Careful, the soldier in the watchtower near the river might be more
dangerous than you'd think.

This level is also "shortsighted", so in this level the soldiers won't
all lump together around the door when one leaves the zoo room.

MAZE:"knox-2",' '
FLAGS: noteleport,shortsighted
GEOMETRY:center,center
